Third-party components
----------------------

This project depends on, but does not include, the Rokid CXR SDK
(for example com.rokid.cxr:client-m), which is proprietary software
of Rokid. It is downloaded from Rokid's Maven repository at build time,
is not covered by the Apache License, Version 2.0, and its use is
subject to Rokid's own terms. Rokid device credentials such as
sn_auth_file.* and ROKID_CLIENT_SECRET are never part of this repository.

Other dependencies are fetched through Gradle and remain under their
respective licenses.
